  "Correct Answer": "D",
  "Accepted Answers": [],
  "Unordered Answers": false,
  "Solution": "$y=x^2-4x+4-4+3=(x-2)^2-1$. In A, the sign of the constant term is incorrect. In B, the sign of the linear term is incorrect. In C, the coefficient 4 was used instead of half of it when completing the square.",
